  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Our brute force search starts over for each new candidate.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 3740,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 112,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "With up to n candidates and up to n array checks for each, the total can grow to n squared.",
      "start_ms": 4200,
      "end_ms": 10760,
      "start_frame": 126,
      "end_frame": 323,
      "word_count": 20
    },
    {
      "text": "What are we actually asking each time?",
      "start_ms": 12080,
      "end_ms": 14600,
      "start_frame": 362,
      "end_frame": 438,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Only this.",
      "start_ms": 15480,
      "end_ms": 16280,
      "start_frame": 464,
      "end_frame": 488,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Is this number present?",
      "start_ms": 16760,
      "end_ms": 18220,
      "start_frame": 503,
      "end_frame": 547,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "We can store the array's values once in a hash set.",
      "start_ms": 18840,
      "end_ms": 22420,
      "start_frame": 565,
      "end_frame": 673,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "A set keeps unique values.",
      "start_ms": 23060,
      "end_ms": 24980,
      "start_frame": 692,
      "end_frame": 749,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "When a duplicate arrives, nothing new needs to be stored.",
      "start_ms": 25620,
      "end_ms": 29520,
      "start_frame": 769,
      "end_frame": 886,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Then we test candidates.",
      "start_ms": 30300,
      "end_ms": 31700,
      "start_frame": 909,
      "end_frame": 951,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "1, 2, 3.",
      "start_ms": 32160,
      "end_ms": 34120,
      "start_frame": 965,
      "end_frame": 1024,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Using expected constant time membership checks instead of scanning the array again.",
      "start_ms": 34540,
      "end_ms": 39920,
      "start_frame": 1036,
      "end_frame": 1198,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "The first missing candidate is still the answer, for the same reason as before.",
      "start_ms": 40660,
      "end_ms": 45920,
      "start_frame": 1220,
      "end_frame": 1378,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "Now watch the set being built.",
      "start_ms": 46940,
      "end_ms": 48800,
      "start_frame": 1408,
      "end_frame": 1464,
      "word_count": 6
    }
  ],
